# basePath DesignNMOS
// NMOS

::Intro
@trigger    OnDesignSetupComplete
$set temp:hintGiven = 0
{@PAL} Use both doping types to make a transistor that starts blocked, and opens with the right signal.

::Hints
@trigger    OnSingleTestComplete
@when       result == "failure"
$if temp:hintGiven == 0
    {@PAL}  Hint: Check the Verification Table. When A is HI, let signal through to X.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 1
$elseif temp:hintGiven == 1
    {@PAL}  Hint: Use alternating “N-P-N” semiconductor to make a to make a blocked gate, opened by HI.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 2
$elseif temp:hintGiven == 2
    {@PAL}  Hint: A controls the gate, and B reaches the output.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 0
$endif